        "locator": "title and description",
        "excerpt": "PR: Update routing syntax [closed; labels kind/enhancement, size/L, area/rules, breaking]\n### What does this PR do?\n\n- Regexp matcher now uses Go's regexp syntax.\n- Regexp matchers are now explicitly named `SomeMatcherRegexp`.\n- All matchers now take a single value and should be explicitly combined using logical operators to mimic previous behavior.\n- Remove the deprecated `HostHeader` matcher.\n- Rename `Headers*` matchers to `Header*`\n\n### Motivation\n\nFixes #9520\n\n### More\n\n- [x] Added/updated tests\n- [x] Added/updated documentation\n\n### Additional Notes\n\nCo-authored-by: Tom Moulard",
